title: "Indigenous Languages of Peru: A Curated Dataset of Language Types, Families, ISO Codes, and Speaking Peoples"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
url: "https://github.com/lightbluetitan/indigenous-languages-peru"
repository-code: "https://github.com/lightbluetitan/indigenous-languages-peru"
abstract: "A curated dataset of the indigenous or native languages of Peru, including language type (Andean or Amazonian), linguistic family, ISO language code, and the indigenous peoples who speak each language. Variable names are in English, while the data values are in Spanish, following the original terminology and official spellings of the languages."
